NixOS/Nix users can use the flake stored in the repository.
Known issue for the flake! Recar version may not be displayed in the settings page!

1.1.0, 1.1.1 and 1.1.2 adds the following:
- New global calling popup, styled to your Discord client.
- Major Settings UI overhaul, and a new Information/Credits page.
- The Vencord WebRichPresence plugin is now handled directly by recar, instead of spoofing legcord and needing to manually enable it.
- Vencord & Equicord updated to the latest as of posting.

A bug related to links opening as recar windows was fixed by @ClaytonTDM, plus some additional qol stuff was added by him!
